Description: Realtek r8169 Ethernet driver with newer fixes for Proxmox kernels (DKMS)
 This package provides the source code of the Linux kernel's r8169 driver
 for Realtek RTL8169/8168/8101/8125/8126/8127 Ethernet controllers as
 shipped with the Proxmox VE / Proxmox Backup Server 7.0 kernel, extended
 with newer fixes and device support from mainline Linux and the Linux
 stable trees. DKMS builds it for each installed Proxmox 7.0 kernel
 (7.0.14-22-pve or later) and installs it so that it takes precedence over
 the r8169 module shipped with the kernel.
 .
 Kernel headers for every kernel the module should be built for must be
 installed (proxmox-default-headers or proxmox-headers-<version>).
